  "method": "Local deterministic CPU transcription with model-estimated word timestamps; no human verification or authenticity inference.",
  "text": " Heddy surl often took the opportunity, when her aunt's back was turned, of looking at the pleasing reflection of herself in those polished services. For the oak table was usually turned up like a screen, and was more for ornament than for use. And she could see herself sometimes in the great round pewter dishes that were arranged on the shelves above the long-deal dinner table, or in the Hobbes of the Great, which always shown like Jasper.",
